      "confidence": 0.936943531036377,
      "reading_order": 6,
      "text": "2. Since A and B belong to the 16th and 17th\ngroups, the molecule is a polar covalent mole-\ncule. Hence, the force of attraction among them\nis dipole–dipole interaction.\nHence, the correct option is (a)."
    },
    {
