      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.678093433380127,
      "reading_order": 7,
      "text": "3. In hydrochloric acid, $\\mathrm{H}_3\\mathrm{O}^+$ ions are present.\nIn $\\mathrm{H}_3\\mathrm{O}^+$, dative bond is present between $\\mathrm{H}_2\\mathrm{O}$\nand $\\mathrm{H}^+$."
