      "reading_order": 9,
      "text": "4. In $\\mathrm{BCl}_3$, boron (B) has six electrons in its valence\nshell.\n\nHence, the correct option is (c)."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260312_53230d52-1143-496b-ac7c-3377ccdd9795_6_block_009",
