        "y2": 1763.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.9291974902153015,
      "reading_order": 10,
      "text": "5. Significant difference in ionization energy is\nthe most suitable among the given conditions\nfor the formation of an ionic bond.\nHence, the correct option is (a)."
    },
